{"speciesId":259,"names":{"fr":"Flobio","es":"Marshtomp","en":"Marshtomp","ja":"ヌマクロー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The surface of MARSHTOMP’s body is enveloped by a thin, sticky film that enables it to live on land. This POKéMON plays in mud on beaches when the ocean tide is low."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MARSHTOMP is much faster at traveling through mud than it is at swimming. This POKéMON’s hindquarters exhibit obvious development, giving it the ability to walk on just its hind legs."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand upright. Because it weakens if its skin dries out, it replenishes fluids by playing in mud."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is at its best when on muddy ground with poor footing. It quickly overwhelms foes struggling in mud."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is at its best when on muddy ground with poor footing. It quickly overwhelms foes struggling in mud."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses jambes robustes lui donnent un bon appui, même dans la boue. Il dort enfoui dans la saleté."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses jambes robustes lui donnent un bon appui, même dans la boue. Il dort enfoui dans la saleté."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses jambes robustes lui donnent un bon appui, même dans la boue. Il dort enfoui dans la saleté."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus piernas robustas impiden que pierda el equilibrio y caiga, incluso en el barro. Duerme bajo la arena."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ぬかるんだ 足場でも しっかり 歩ける 丈夫な 足腰。 泥に 体を 埋めて 眠る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"À force de marcher et de vivre dans la boue, son arrière-train est devenu particulièrement robuste."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en el lodo, lo que contribuye a que sus piernas sean extremadamente robustas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ドロドロに ぬかるんだ 足場で 生活する うちに 鍛えられ 強靭な 足腰に なった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Flobio est enveloppé par un film fin et collant qui lui permet de vivre hors de l’eau. Ce Pokémon joue dans la vase sur les plages lorsque la marée est basse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El cuerpo de Marshtomp está cubierto por una fina película pegajosa gracias a la cual puede vivir en tierra. Cuando la marea está baja, a este Pokémon le encanta jugar en el fango."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The surface of Marshtomp’s body is enveloped by a thin, sticky film that enables it to live on land. This Pokémon plays in mud on beaches when the ocean tide is low."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"地上でも 生活できる ように 体の 表面を 薄い 粘膜が 包んでいる。 潮の 引いた 海岸で 泥遊びを する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Flobio est bien plus rapide dans la boue que dans l’eau. L’arrière-train de ce Pokémon est particulièrement développé, ce qui lui donne la capacité de marcher sur ses pattes arrière."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Marshtomp se desplaza más rápido por el lodo que por el agua. Los cuartos traseros de este Pokémon muestran un desarrollo más que evidente, lo que le permite andar solo sobre las patas traseras."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Marshtomp is much faster at traveling through mud than it is at swimming. This Pokémon’s hindquarters exhibit obvious development, giving it the ability to walk on just its hind legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"水中を 泳ぐより 泥の 中を 進む ほうが 断然 速く 移動できる。 足腰が 発達して ２本足で 歩く。"}],"varieties":[{"id":259,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",31],[6,"level-up",31],[7,"level-up",31],[8,"level-up",31],[9,"le